2026-08-24 14:20:13 | INFO     | outreach.main | Profile: yukta (Yukta Sethi)
2026-08-24 14:20:13 | INFO     | outreach.main | Sender (From): yuktasethi@gmail.com
2026-08-24 14:20:13 | INFO     | outreach.main | Resume: /home/omsinghan/email-automation/YUKTA_SETHI_RESUME.pdf
2026-08-24 14:20:13 | INFO     | outreach.main | Scheduled send time (local): 2026-08-25T08:00:00-05:00
