I really like how Anthelion Capital pairs serious trading technology with disciplined risk management. Work like this sits exactly where I do my best thinking, at the meeting point of modeling, software, and high-visibility risk and P&L work. The chance to build and improve risk analytics platforms and to dig into model performance, backtesting, and P&L attribution is the kind of problem I'd happily lose a weekend to.

I've attached my resume, and if my background looks like a fit for anything you're working on, I'd truly welcome the chance to connect. Even a brief conversation would mean a lot.

Warm regards,

