I really like how Vatic Labs pairs serious trading technology with disciplined risk management. Work like this sits exactly where I do my best thinking, at the meeting point of modeling, software, and high-visibility risk and P&L work. The chance to build and improve risk analytics platforms and to dig into model performance, backtesting, and P&L attribution is the kind of problem I'd happily lose a weekend to.

